    {
        "segmentnr": "PA_pp_1.5:2.1",
        "original": "Atthekacco puggalo ārabhati ca vippaṭisārī ca hoti, tañca cetovimuttiṁ paññāvimuttiṁ yathābhūtaṁ nappajānāti, yatthassa te uppannā pāpakā akusalā dhammā aparisesā nirujjhanti.",
        "analyzed": "attha ekaccaḥ puggalaḥ ārabhati ca vippaṭisārī ca hoti tat ca cetaḥ vimuttim paññā vimuttim yathābhūtam na pajānāti yattha assa te uppannā pāpakāḥ akusalāḥ dhammāḥ aparisesāḥ nirujjhanti ",
        "folio": "2",
        "suttacentral_link": "https://suttacentral.net/pp1.5/pli/ms#2.1"
    },
